From 58ca4b65d7412e9a81a232ce26459145ec5154e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CounterStrikeXB2 <cs2@local>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:16:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] nv2a: unify fixed-function transform state and inline draws

Share the hardware transform context with vertex-program constants, transform inline vertices in fixed-function mode, and safely clip large raster bounds.

Co-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
